Description: the depth layers' strings in nine languages
 Eighteen strings (the layer type, its actions and their tooltips, the
 Layers dock's Depth, the undo steps, the messages) in Polish, Brazilian
 Portuguese, French, German, Spanish, Japanese, Korean and Chinese
 (simplified and traditional), additions only, in GIMP's own terms (layer
 group: Ebenengruppe, grupo de camadas, groupe de calques...); the four new
 source files in POTFILES.in.  For GIMP's translators to take over upstream.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: other, Sparky Stereo OS (queue row 137 with row 148, the stereo GIMP's milestone 2)
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-26
---
